Package: gowitness
Version: 3.2.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, golang, tar, gzip
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sensepost/gowitness
Description: Web screenshot utility using headless Chrome
 gowitness is a web screenshot tool that captures screenshots of
 websites using headless Chrome, with support for multiple input
 formats and output options.
